# This repository contains only the React Native app, and nothing at the root
# reads a .env file.
#
# Mobile app configuration:
#   cp apps/mobile/.env.example apps/mobile/.env
#
# Those values are inlined at build time by react-native-dotenv and must be
# imported from '@env' — process.env does not work in React Native. See
# apps/mobile/.env.example for the full list and the reasoning.
#
# Backend configuration (DATABASE_URL, JWT secrets, Razorpay, Twilio, MinIO)
# belongs to the carebow-main repository:
#   https://github.com/mopshyai/carebow-main
#
# This file previously documented an apps/api backend that no longer exists,
# alongside mobile keys the app never read (API_URL, MIXPANEL_TOKEN,
# AMPLITUDE_API_KEY). Copying it produced a broken setup.
